      "name": "SatisfyingOverlay",
      "slug": "satisfyingoverlay",
      "teaser": "Because nothing calms you down like a rug being pressure-washed…\r\n...while you're bleeding out in Interchange.",
      "thumbnail": "https://forge-static.sp-tarkov.com/mods/2901.png",
      "downloads": 711,
      "favourites_count": 0,
      "description": "<h2><strong>This mod adds configurable video-overlay directly into your SPT raids.</strong></h2>\n<h2>Pure visual dopamine, perfect for tactical vibing mid-fight.</h2>\n<h2><strong>🧠 Features</strong></h2>\n<ul>\n<li>🎥 Plays videos during raids\n<ul>\n<li>Supports adding up to 10 videos at the same time!!</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li>⚙️ Fully separate configurable for each video-player:\n<ul>\n<li>Position (X/Y)</li>\n<li>Scale (Width/Height)</li>\n<li>Transparency</li>\n<li>Audio toggle</li>\n<li>Setup video from folder mod</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h3><strong>🔧 Installation:</strong></h3>\n<h3><strong>Install <a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://hub.sp-tarkov.com/files/file/1215-kmy-tarkov-api/\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">KmyTarkovApi</a> 1.4.0 or later, You MUST install it</strong></h3>\n<h3><strong>Extract BepInEx folder from 7z to Game Root directory. Profit!</strong></h3>\n<h3><strong>How to use</strong></h3>\n<div class=\"youtube-lite\" data-video-id=\"ZoWvqE2H6d4\" data-embed-url=\"https://www.youtube-nocookie.com/embed/ZoWvqE2H6d4?autoplay=1\"><img src=\"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/ZoWvqE2H6d4/hqdefault.jpg\" alt=\"YouTube video thumbnail\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" /></div>\n<h3><strong>🔹How do add my videos?</strong></h3>\n<ul>\n<li>Put your .mp4 videos in this folder:<br />\nBepInEx/plugins/SatisfyingOverlay/Videos</li>\n<li>Start SPT</li>\n<li>Press F12 to open configurator</li>\n<li>Choose a new added video in dropdown</li>\n</ul>\n<h3><strong>🔹Does this work outside of raids?</strong></h3>\n<ul>\n<li>No. Videos only play <strong>during raids.</strong></li>\n</ul>\n<h3><strong>🔹Why is the weight of the archive large?</strong></h3>\n<ul>\n<li>Because embedded with the mod 5 example videos:\n<ul>\n<li>Carpet cleaning</li>\n<li>Kinetic sand cutting</li>\n<li>Slime</li>\n<li>Soap crush</li>\n<li>Subway Surf gameplay</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h3><strong>🔹Can videos play sound?</strong></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Yes! Turn on “AudioEnable” in settings video-slot Volume is linked to in-game music volume slider</strong></li>\n</ul>\n<h3><strong>🔹My video doesn’t show up!</strong></h3>\n<ul>\n<li>Make sure it’s an .mp4 file.</li>\n<li>Avoid weird characters in the name.</li>\n<li>Re-encode the video by ffmpeg ffmpeg -i broken.mp4 -c:v libx264 -c:a aac fixed.mp4</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Made by Katrin0522 aka Kat.</p>\n<p>Idea sparked by pure overstimulation and a love for oddly satisfying TikToks.</p>\n",
